=== entry 56fa3df3e949
kind: translation
rules: paths, setup-pstack, invoke
intent: Install step says the skills go into the project's `.agents/skills/` with the `skills` CLI, and setup writes the project models file that skills read at each spawn. Keep the three steps and their order. The steps tell the user what to type, so each skill gets its Codex form.
--- upstream
1. Install with `/add-plugin pstack` in chat, or from Customize in the sidebar.
2. Run [`/setup-pstack`](../setup-pstack/SKILL.md). It asks for a reasoning budget, maps a model to each role, and writes a rule. The rule applies to new chats.
3. Start a real task with `/poteto-mode`, a goal, and a check that can pass or fail.
--- patched
1. Install every pstack skill into the project's `.agents/skills/` with the `skills` CLI. They read each other, so take them all.
2. Run [`/setup-pstack`](../setup-pstack/SKILL.md) (`$setup-pstack` in Codex). It asks for a reasoning budget, maps a model to each role, and writes {{snippet:models-file}}. Skills read it at each spawn.
3. Start a real task with `/poteto-mode` (`$poteto-mode` in Codex), a goal, and a check that can pass or fail.

=== entry 6073a15e97f2
kind: translation
rules: model-role, invoke
intent: Drops the `auto` alias and Cursor's Auto model; `inherit-parent` is the only alias. Keep the cost advice otherwise. The skills the user reruns or starts get their Codex form.
--- upstream
If cost is the worry, say where the tokens go and how to spend fewer. pstack spends extra tokens on subagents and review panels. Rerun `/setup-pstack` and pick a smaller budget or cheaper models. A role set to `auto` or `inherit-parent` runs on the chat's model, which saves tokens when the chat runs on Auto or a cheaper model. A shorter panel list runs fewer subagents, one for each entry. Save `/poteto-mode` for work that needs rigor.
--- patched
If cost is the worry, say where the tokens go and how to spend fewer. pstack spends extra tokens on subagents and review panels. Rerun `/setup-pstack` (`$setup-pstack` in Codex) and pick a smaller budget or cheaper models. A role set to `inherit-parent` runs on the chat's model, which saves tokens when the chat runs on a cheaper model. A shorter panel list runs fewer subagents, one for each entry. Save `/poteto-mode` (`$poteto-mode` in Codex) for work that needs rigor.

